OL,3,GNEWSAStolen Sycamore Gap sapling
OL,4,Amystery continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FCumbria Police has now said it has been
OL,7,Fforced to close its investigation into
OL,8,Fthe theft as it has explored all lines
OL,9,Fof inquiry. Nevertheless it urged
OL,10,Fpeople with information about the crime
OL,11,Fto contact the force.
